<div class="modal fade" id="modalBiometriaFacial" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="modalBiometriaFacialLabel" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title" id="modalBiometriaFacialLabel">Captura Biométrica Facial</h5>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-12 d-flex align-items-end gap-2">
            <div class="flex-grow-1">
              <label for="cameraSelect" class="form-label mb-1">Câmera</label>
              <select id="cameraSelect" class="form-select form-select-sm">
                <option value="">(padrão / frontal)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" id="cameraRefresh" title="Atualizar lista de dispositivos">Atualizar</button>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="face-steps-bar mb-2" id="faceStepsBar">
              <div class="face-step" data-step="0">
                <div class="icon">1</div>
                <div class="lbl">Frontal</div>
              </div>
              <div class="sep"></div>
              <div class="face-step" data-step="1">
                <div class="icon">2</div>
                <div class="lbl">Direita</div>
              </div>
              <div class="sep"></div>
              <div class="face-step" data-step="2">
                <div class="icon">3</div>
                <div class="lbl">Esquerda</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="face-instruction-block" id="faceInstructionBlock">
              <div class="primary" id="faceInstructionPrimary">Inicie a captura frontal.</div>
              <div class="secondary text-muted small" id="faceInstructionSecondary">Posicione o rosto dentro do círculo. Iluminação uniforme. Sem óculos escuros ou boné.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-7">
            <div id="faceVideoWrap" class="ratio ratio-4x3 border rounded position-relative bg-dark">
              <video id="faceVideo" autoplay playsinline muted class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit: cover; z-index:1;"></video>
              <div id="faceOverlay" class="position-absolute top-0 start-0 w-100 h-100" style="pointer-events:none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(0,123,255,.6); z-index:2;"></div>
              <canvas id="faceOverlayCanvas" class="position-absolute top-0 start-0 w-100 h-100" style="pointer-events:none; z-index:3;"></canvas>
            </div>
            <canvas id="faceCanvas" class="d-none" style="width:0;height:0;visibility:hidden;"></canvas>
            <div id="faceInstructionExternal" class="mt-2 fw-semibold small text-primary">—</div>
            <div class="mt-2 d-flex gap-2 align-items-center">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="btnFaceCapture">Capturar</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="btnFaceClear">Limpar</button>
              <div class="small text-muted">Mantenha o rosto alinhado conforme instruções na área do vídeo.</div>
            </div>

            <div id="faceThumbs" class="mt-2 d-flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-5">
            <div class="small text-muted">Pré-visualização e dados</div>
            <div id="faceStatus" class="form-text mb-2">Câmera não iniciada ainda…</div>
            <ul class="list-group list-group-flush small">
              <li class="list-group-item px-0">Imagem: <span id="faceImgSize">—</span></li>
              <li class="list-group-item px-0">SHA-256: <code id="faceSha256">—</code></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-2">
              <div class="small text-muted mb-1">Hashes das Capturas</div>
              <div id="facialHashesList" class="d-flex flex-column gap-1 small"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="btnConfirmarFacial" disabled>Confirmar</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>